{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","prNumber":1,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/pull/1","prRepository":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:23:22.961Z"}
{"parentUuid":"911b1383-f0dc-4cce-983d-74c9ffd0ea9f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgY29iWtK1tiy93JXJe3z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2A.6: RUNNING. Nothing is needed from you yet.\n\nThe eval A code is written and tested, and `make eval` now runs it. Its first pass, over all 1.05M candidates, is running in the background. It measures five things:\n- **Counts:** candidates by year, state and term.\n- **Length:** how long each candidate is.\n- **OCR quality:** the share of words found in the system's standard English dictionary.\n- **Reprints:** candidates that share runs of words, taken to be the same story printed in several papers.\n- **Samples to judge:** 200 candidates, and 300 articles each from the near-miss and random reservoirs, drawn so they stand for the whole archive rather than each year equally.\n\nWhen the pass finishes, I'll judge those samples by hand, plus 20 reprint clusters to check the clustering. Then I'll send the headline numbers, the composition table, the recall result and the list of charts."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1417,"cache_read_input_tokens":836236,"output_tokens":298,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1417,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":836236,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1417,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1417},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"935fd1bb-69b8-41f1-a068-d07cd9ae5b16","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_01