{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","id":"85607168-2fd2-46a4-ac05-71e5fe58acc9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:46:57.696Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"2dfe311ab556df9afa01866e60c2707904736e19c2b14d5e93fc68f7bf73975b","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"f7689917-cf78-4041-8da5-c24b6c8196b6","keep":129,"tail":["d94ba9db85cd6ba0f219ef3684e6a20cd10bd19368d1e69f141136197046d201","bbeea8b6e5bed0ae326d6349555ab4f4cbdc36dd052a27ae9f8e81530cb38805"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",130,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"a07725e7d1747a57c607eb2bd4526dfddc15f5c8605b081cddac79616cba489e"}
{"parentUuid":"9210eaa4-ea9e-48c6-8bde-53d361818681","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgY3x1QnHzmkD7DPs52x6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2A.6: DONE. Commit `ba247a0` is pushed with decision 27. Full notes are in `step-2A.6.md`.\n\n**Headline numbers:**\n- 370,313,913 articles gave 1,050,459 candidates, 2,837 per million.\n- 11.2% of candidates have no state.\n- Median length is 358 words, and median OCR quality is 92.7%.\n- Reprint clusters hold 31.4% of candidates, which leaves 801,071 distinct stories. All 20 sampled pairs were the same story.\n\n**Composition** (200 candidates):\n\n| Category | n | 95% interval |\n|---|---|---|\n| figurative | 79 | 33.0–46.4% |\n| fiction | 47 | 18.2–29.8% |\n| name or title | 30 | 10.7–20.6% |\n| other (15 OCR misreads) | 23 | 7.8–16.7% |\n| religious | 10 | 2.7–9.0% |\n| ghost report | 7 | 1.7–7.0%, about 36.8K candidates or 22.3K stories |\n| social event | 4 | 0.8–5.0% |\n\n**Recall:** no ghost reports in either sample of 300, so each pool's rate is at most 1.26%:\n- Near-miss: at most 86.9K articles.\n- All non-candidates: at most 4.67M, a bound too loose to be useful.\n\nWith no misses, there's no lexicon v2 to propose.\n\n**Charts:** years, states, terms, lengths, ocr, reprints, composition and recall.\n\n**Question:** should I tighten the random bound by flag-word screening 38,600 random articles, then reading the roughly 1,200 that hit?\n\nThe Phase 2A STATUS block is still to write, at the gate."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":212572,"output_tokens":585,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations