{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","hash":"fc9b057e5c9bed145b6a62cd6f7349f104c60b23b1f7c41c56e9aab0bd5c5873","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016nEjF2F9TZ5mKmiQ2D4Kqs","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2A.5-follow-ups.md","old_string":"## Suggested next","new_string":"## 2B plan (commit `2ae86fa`, after the EM's yes)\n\n`Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md` section 2B now includes:\n- The reel-to-batch map. It is validated by hiding the batch on pages that have one, and every reel with more than one batch is flagged. This is also a 2B gate item.\n- No loc.gov lookups for the 25,595 uncovered candidates until the reader makes them reports. Those go through `crops.get` at one request every 3.5 s, with each answer cached, since `page_service` doesn't cache today.\n\n## Suggested next (superseded by the plan above)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014A2b3G6mzQ3K4tDVHRppkt","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up","input":{"recap":"2B notes: DONE. Commit 2ae86fa adds the reel-to-batch map, its validation and the deferred loc.gov lookups to the 2B plan. 2A.6 was already done in ba247a0 and is waiting on the EM's review and the random-bound question."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
