{"parentUuid":"c45ad919-abc1-44fe-9e69-ab22c2456f24","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"efbe7dae-4a3a-47ef-9f27-91c90fdaed9c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017HWZNEbruHSsk2NgDqt1Dv","type":"tool_result","content":"63 files already formatted\npnpm --dir web lint\n$ oxlint\npnpm --dir web exec tsc -b\n\n============================= 160 passed in 9.74s ==============================","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"86f643e9-b912-447a-91c9-57140932897d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T14:32:17.018Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"63 files already formatted\npnpm --dir web lint\n$ oxlint\npnpm --dir web exec tsc -b\n\n============================= 160 passed in 9.74s ==============================","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":182,"oldLines":7,"newStart":182,"newLines":7,"lines":["   - Atlas would hold about 22,300 ghost-report stories, counting each candidate as 1/k of a story when its cluster holds k printings. Three of the 7 reports were reprinted (7, 13 and 30 printings), so this is a rough estimate."," - Recall, from the seeded reservoirs of 2,000 articles per year, with each year weighted by its pool's size:","   - Near-miss pool: 0 ghost reports in 300, so at most 1.26% (95%), or at most 86,900 of its 6,872,539 articles. The sample's terms are spirit (210), knock (80), supernatural (4), spiritualism (4), rap (3) and seance (3).","-  - All non-candidates: 0 in 300, so at most 1.26%, or at most 4.67 million of 369,263,454. This bound is loose, at 127 times the ghost reports found. Bounding the misses at the 36,800 found would take about 38,600 articles with none among them.","+  - All non-candidates: 0 in 300, so at most 1.26%, or at most 4.67 million of 369,263,454. This bound is loose, at 127 times the ghost reports found. Bounding the misses at the 36,800 found would take about 38,600 articles with none among them. Decision 30 screens that many, and finds 4.","   - The closest calls were a séance announcement promising that spirits \"will materialize\" and a Kentucky girl who claims to be a witch."," - No misses means no shared vocabulary to add, so there is no lexicon v2. A re-read would take 118.6 min and 340.4 GB of downloads at four processes (decision 25)."," - Both chart series colors pass the dataviz palette validator, on the light surface and on the dark one."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ad3e52c8-8b15-4edd-8450-379721350bd1","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2a-archive","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":10,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c45ad919-abc1-44fe-9e69-ab22c2456f24","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2a-archive","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
