files, search the web, or write code that decides verdicts (keyword rules would defeat the purpose). You may run one short script at the end only to check that your output is valid JSON with exactly one verdict for every id.\n\nReply with the count of each verdict and every id you marked close or report, with its note. Nothing else."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2313,"cache_read_input_tokens":138134,"output_tokens":6775,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":758},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2313,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6775,"cache_read_input_tokens":138134,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2313,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2313},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01PNm4uwXA6hJNLqBf6ks6KR":{"description":"Judge added-candidate batch 3","subagent_type":"general-purpose","prompt":"You are judging old newspaper articles for an evaluation of a ghost-report search over the Library of Congress's digitized American newspapers (1770s to 1960s). Every article in your batch was drawn at random from the articles that the search's new spiritualist terms made candidates, and that its older ghost words did not. Each holds at least one of: spiritualism or spiritualist(s); séance; a spirit phrase such as spirit world, spirit message, control of spirits, disembodied, or spirits of the dead; ouija or planchette; or the words spirit and medium somewhere in one article. For each article, decide one thing: is it a ghost report?\n\nGHOST REPORT, the only positive: a ghost, haunting, apparition o