{"parentUuid":"f81b695e-0559-40c7-a3c2-903a72c8a6c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYoBMW8y3n61VFM6esA2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2A.8: DONE. Lexicon v2 is in PR #3 into main: https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/pull/3. Its CI checks hadn't started when it opened.\n\n- **Re-read:** all 180 years ran at the first attempt, on one code version. All of v1's 1,050,459 candidates are still candidates, and v2 adds 185,663. Rerunning 1850 gave byte-identical outputs, and disk use is 4.1 GB.\n- **Sample of 200 added candidates:** 14 are reports, 7.0% (4.2–11.4%). That is about 13,000 reports gained, 2 of the 14 borderline. Every rule has reports except ouija, flagged with none in its 6 (0–39%); dropping it would remove 5,124 candidates.\n- **Beyond your protocol:** I also read in full the 8 negatives the agents noted as near. One became a report, so it's 13 without that reading.\n- **Recall:** 84%, and at least 48%. That figure is in-sample; 2C's eval B gives the independent one.\n- **Close-out:** decision 31, the STATUS block, and the six EDA charts regenerated and checked in both themes.\n\nThe details are in `step-2A.8.md` in the notes folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":649,"cache_read_input_tokens":318761,"output_tokens":423,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":649,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":423,"cache_read_input_tokens":318761,"cache_creation_input_tokens":649,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":649},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"co