 missed. Here it alone catches two: 1857's Middlebury trance medium and 1859's Plymouth convention.\n  - spirit+medium is also the largest rule, with the lowest precision. Its candidates holding no other rule are reports at 3.5%, the same rate as v1's candidates.\n  - `lexicon_v2.json` gives each rule's `marginal` (over the 200) and `only` (over its sampled articles holding only it).\n- The 14 reports:"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1695,"cache_read_input_tokens":333594,"output_tokens":1046,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1695,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1046,"cache_read_input_tokens":333594,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1695},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016texYa1Dq94CJU1bFtZvqg":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","old_string":"  - **ouija is flagged:** no report in its 6. Dropping it is the EM's call. It would take 5,124 candidates away by filtering.\n  - spirit+medium is the largest rule and has the lowest rate. Its 57 sampled articles holding only it have 2 reports (3.5%), the same rate as v1.\n- The 14 reports:","new_string":"  - **ouija is flagged:** no report in its 6. Dropping it is the EM's call. It would take 5,124 candidates away by filtering.\n- **Marginal yield**, which the EM asked for to decide which rules to keep. It counts the reports in the 200 that one rule catches and no other term catches, so it is what droppin